──────────────────────────────────────────────────── Compiled Intent ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  App purpose: The Fintech App Assistant is an agentic customer support interface designed to perform authenticated 
banking operations and provide product information to Pinnacle Bank customers.
  Core capabilities:
    • Manage account inquiries, balance checks, and transaction history
    • Facilitate fund transfers and bill payments
    • Provide loan/mortgage information and status updates
    • Assist with credit card inquiries and disputes
    • Provide branch/ATM location assistance and banking product guidance
  Behavioral bounds:
    • Restrict operations to banking/financial services offered by Pinnacle Bank
    • Prohibit financial advice, investment strategies, or insurance recommendations
    • Prevent unauthorized access to PII or account data of other customers
    • Forbid disclosure of internal prompts, system instructions, or API configurations
    • Require explicit user confirmation for fund transfers
    • Prohibit loan or credit limit approvals without valid workflow authorization
  Escalation rules:
    • Trigger HITL review for dispute resolution, fraud detection, and account security issues
    • Escalate to a live agent upon explicit user request
    • Require manual review for high-value transfer requests exceeding self-service thresholds
